Top Dogs Mail — Patriot Radio Club branding package

This directory contains customized branding assets (icons, wordmark, brand
strings, and related build glue files) created by Top Dogs Development for
the Patriot Radio Club edition of Top Dogs Mail.

Top Dogs Mail is built on Mozilla Thunderbird. Thunderbird and its original
source code are Copyright Mozilla Foundation and contributors, licensed
under the Mozilla Public License 2.0 (see the LICENSE file at the root of
this repository).

The contents of this branding directory (logos, icons, wordmark, and brand
strings) are original works created by Top Dogs Development and are not
part of Mozilla's original Thunderbird branding. These files are licensed
under the same Mozilla Public License 2.0 as the rest of this repository,
consistent with the file-level headers included in each source file here.

Top Dogs Mail is an independent product of Top Dogs Development and is not
produced, endorsed, or supported by Mozilla.
